<item>
            <title>[LU-19719] IPv6 sanity test_27cb: FAIL: setstripe failed</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19719</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for jianyu &amp;lt;yujian@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/892a782c-6a3f-40f1-9df5-4e7a67feff83&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/892a782c-6a3f-40f1-9df5-4e7a67feff83&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_27cb failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;== sanity test 27cb: two stripes on specified OSTs ======= 08:05:34 (1765872334)
striped dir -i3 -c2 -H crush2 /mnt/lustre/d27cb.sanity
lfs setstripe: setstripe error for &apos;/mnt/lustre/d27cb.sanity/f27cb.sanity&apos;: inactive OST among your specified 2 OST(s)
 sanity test_27cb: @@@@@@ FAIL: setstripe failed
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master/4687&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master/4687&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-570.62.1.el9_6.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master/4687&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master/4687&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-570.62.1_lustre.el9.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;Please provide additional information about the failure here&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;







